//
// Host-only gate for the qwen3-0.6b W4 decode pack (synthetic weights, CPU,
// no device, no model download): the selection flag stays default-OFF until
// R3c, the quant contract columns, the round-trip dequant band, and the
// production-shape pack/substitution/idempotence test. Collected by the
// unfiltered check-programming-examples (review of PR #32, P2).
//
// RUN: %PYTHON %S/test_w4_decode_pack.py | FileCheck %s
//
// CHECK: PASS  test_flag_zero_selects_nothing
// CHECK: PASS  test_quant_contract_columns
// CHECK: PASS  test_quantize_packs_production_shapes_bit_exact_and_idempotent
// CHECK: PASS  test_roundtrip_dequant_band
// CHECK: w4_decode_pack tests: 4/4 passed
